# Planetarium of Wan Shi Tong: "{1}, {T}: Scry 2." and "Whenever you scry or surveil, look at the top card of your library.
# You may cast that card without paying its mana cost." Bot1 puts the Planetarium out on turn 1 with Sol Ring, Black
# Lotus and Mox Jet, and activates it with Mox Sapphire. The scry sees Counterspell and Misshapen Fiend: the Fiend stays
# on top and Counterspell goes to the bottom. Once the scry is complete the ability triggers (CR 701.22d, 603.2): Bot1
# looks at the top card (the Fiend, `Bot1.Looked`) and casts it with no mana left in the pool, so it was cast without
# paying its mana cost (CR 118.9). Counterspell at the bottom proves the scry put it there.

